name yardstick_151_outage_3s_seed6
describe yardstick for #151: outage_3s with every v2 switch on, seed 6, traced on both stacks (parity data only, no expectations)
# Not a regression test. libwebrtc's trace for seed 1 only is published; this one shows whether its congestion-window
# frame-drop phase after the outage varies by seed, and how it orders the NACK burst and the recovery keyframe when it does.
cc v2
pacer v2
tcc v2
rtx v2
rtcp v2
keyframe v2
allocator v2
packetization v2
audio v2
seed 6
compare_seeds 1
duration 30s
at 0s  capacity=1500kbps delay=30ms queue=300ms
at 12s down
at 15s up
reverse at 0s delay=30ms
reverse at 12s down
reverse at 15s up
